== 3. D4 constant (ERRATUM18) ==
  MN2 face: k_x = -eL, internal K = 0 (internal metric r-independent at MN2) => K_int + 6k_x = -6 eL.
  |d(K_int)| <= 6 delta (6 diagonal entries, |dK|_op <= delta), |6 d k_x| <= 6 delta => need 12 delta >= 6 eL, i.e. delta >= eL/2.
  sharpness witness at delta = eL/2: k_x = -eL/2, each internal k = +eL/2: K_int + 6k_x = 0
  NL D4 (10 delta, 3/5) vs ERRATUM18 (12 delta, 1/2): 10 delta -> threshold 3/5 eL (not a valid bound: witness above meets the trace at delta=eL/2 < 3eL/5); 12 delta -> 1/2 eL (correct, sharp for the trace)

